{{> Start this}}

{{!--
  PREHEADER - the inbox preview line. A flap sends a create and a resolve
  every few minutes and every one of them previewed as "Alert state has
  changed", so the list gave the reader nothing to triage on.
--}}
<!-- Preheader (hidden inbox preview) -->
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;color:#f3f4f6;opacity:0;">{{preheader}}</div>

{{> Logo this}}
{{> EmailTitle title=(concat "Alert " alertNumber ": " alertTitle) }}

{{> InfoBlock info="Alert state has changed"}}

{{> DetailBoxStart this }}
{{> StateTransition this}}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Affected Resource:" plainText=resourcesAffected }}
{{!--
  WHY it changed. Populated from AlertStateTimeline.rootCause, which
  MonitorAlert.resolveOpenAlert and AlertService.changeAlertState both write.
  Without it a resolution email said only that the state changed, and a reader
  could not tell a real recovery from a monitor oscillating around its
  threshold.

  `text=`, NOT `plainText=`, even though the fields around it are plainText:
  this value is Markdown.convertToHTML output (which escapes the raw-HTML
  tokens a user typed) and must render as HTML. Do not "align" it with its
  neighbours.

  `{{#if}}` rather than `{{#ifNotCond ... ""}}` because ifNotCond is a strict
  !==, so an ABSENT var would pass it and render an empty bordered row.
--}}
{{#if stateChangeRootCause}}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Root Cause:" blockText=stateChangeRootCause }}
{{/if}}
{{#ifNotCond previousStateDurationText ""}}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Duration in Previous State:" plainText=previousStateDurationText }}
{{/ifNotCond}}
{{> DetailBoxField title="State changed at:" text=stateChangedAt }}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Severity:" plainText=alertSeverity }}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Alert Title:" plainText=alertTitle }}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Description:" blockText=alertDescription }}
{{> DetailBoxEnd this }}


{{> InfoBlock info="You can view this alert by clicking on the button below - "}}

{{> ButtonBlock buttonUrl=alertViewLink buttonText="View on Dashboard"}}

{{> InfoBlock info="You can also copy and paste this link:"}}
{{> InfoBlock info=alertViewLink}}

